			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: The caption
		Paragraph: A `Caption` is a text like a `Text`: one line in its value, or a `Content` block for a longer one. It inherits the `Typography` of the `Figure`, and `Markup: markdown` gives it bold and italic. `For element: Caption` styles every caption.
